  "ja340:1.1": "Adāsi dānāni pure Visayha, ",
  "ja340:1.2": "dadato ca te khayadhammo ahosi, ",
  "ja340:1.3": "itoparañ ce na dadeyya dānaṃ ",
  "ja340:1.4": "tiṭṭheyyuṃ te saṃñamantassa bhogāti. ",
  "ja340:2.1": "Anariyam ariyena sahassanetta ",
  "ja340:2.2": "suduggatenāpi akiccam āhu, ",
  "ja340:2.3": "mā vo dhanan taṃ ahuvā janinda ",
  "ja340:2.4": "yambhogahetu vijahemu saddhaṃ. ",
  "ja340:3.1": "Yena eko ratho yāti ",
  "ja340:3.2": "yāti tenāparo ratho, ",
  "ja340:3.3": "porāṇaṃ nihitaṃ vaḍḍhaṃ vaḍḍhataṃ ",
  "ja340:3.4": "ñeva Vāsava. ",
  "ja340:4.1": "Yadi hessati dassāma, ",
  "ja340:4.2": "asante kiṃ dadāmase, ",
  "ja340:4.3": "evaṃ bhūtāpi dassāma, ",
  "ja340:4.4": "mā dānaṃ pamadamhaseti. ",
